{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_ex01",
  "title": "Feint",
  "storyCode": "RI-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2d3eb11546598507f5eceeea08bf1e9b30a7812deaacab981019e8d451ab6215",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The scorching sun, the wilds, the golden sand, and the warm breeze! Woohoo! I feel a new song coming on!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（solo）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Could the both of you quiet down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Please. It's not often we get such a peaceful environment with no one chasing us. Can't we just have a nice, quiet rest?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But Alty, I can smell the sea from here. Are you sure we're safe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Aya, could you not spoil the mood for once?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nowhere in the world is truly safe, but we have to learn to let ourselves relax sometimes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe you're right."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So what's the next step? How are we going to broaden our path? We can't go back empty-handed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "At least that doctor gave us an answer this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alty looks at the 'key' in her hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Really? That looks like something special. And she just gave it to you? What did you trade for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Knowledge."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And was that a fair trade?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure. But I think that doctor wants us to put this knowledge to use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wouldn't she know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We know a lot, she should just..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...If you think about it, the real trade was her using our curiosity to get us to act."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, that means she didn't pay anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've been cheated."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "More like baited."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Directed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Guided."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Is that doctor really so important?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No. I think she's trying to tell us that her actions have no impact at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What matters is what we think and what we do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then what about the key? Should we go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ugh, this sucks. Could we not go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm thinking it's sort of like music... Our power should not be to force change onto others, we should just be singing our own songs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Sing for them. If it sounds good—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then they'll sing too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（solo）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hah, then we will give even more knowledge, and the key, over to the one who is ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And who will that be?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe they haven't been born yet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That would be great!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "No it wouldn't, Dan. We... hm?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is it, Alty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The car's dead."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Didn't you prep it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, but we took that detour."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I have to admit, it's really easy to lose your heading in the middle of the wilderness with no roads or signs."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So basically, we're lost?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm not sure that's how I'd put it. It's not so much that we're off course as it is we're carving a new path."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're lost! That's a pretty good theme."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You know, Dan, I really wish I could learn some of your optimism. So what are we going to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It looks like there's a rainforest over that way. Let's check it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So, who's getting out to push?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We could take turns."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We've got a crowd here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, we do."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I don't know what language they're speaking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So should we just let them follow us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Do you have a better idea?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We could kill them all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You think you can get Frost and Dan to go along with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Strumming and singing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_071",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "&*......%$ ....& (W-What is this sound? And why do I like it so much?!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_072",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "&%......% (I've never heard anything like it...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey, how is everybody?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Can you tell me what language you're speaking?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, but I guess even if you told me, I still wouldn't know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_073",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......%&$ (Where did they come from?!)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria D",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_070",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "$......&# (And why does this one look so weird?)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, at least there are people here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I just hope there's a place we can resupply."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Wishful thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "You're outsiders?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh? You speak Sargonian?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "Yes, it looks like you're definitely outsiders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "What are you doing here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Our car died, so we're looking for someone with the Arts to recharge it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "...Come with me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "See, Aya, that was more than just wishful thinking."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Fine. I guess the world is a magical place."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hey hey hey! What's this?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's a village here in the middle of this primeval forest!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Humming)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's really amazing. You can see the influence of modern architecture on most of the buildings, but they still have that primitive beauty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's odd, but very special."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "I am the leader of this tribe, Zumama. Most of my people can understand your language."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "I can have some of our priests recharge your vehicle, but there are terms."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What terms?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "I want to look inside your vehicle, at its structure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Is that all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Are you sure you won't break it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "I'm pretty sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's not like we have a choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "So...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Agreed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "speakerToken": "char_416_zumama_1",
      "operatorId": "char_416_zumama",
      "portraitKey": "char_416_zumama",
      "text": "Good. High Priest..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'm here! ...Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Hmmmmm....?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know of you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know of you..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I never expected to see your kind here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, honestly, I was thinking the exact same thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But I'm more interested in your vehicle than you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "By all means."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I said it before and I'll say it again. The world is a magical place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I have to say, I agree."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At the same time, Frost hooks her guitar up to the ceremonial speaker and improvises a solo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Nice, Frost."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This village is inspiring me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Awesome, Frost, you really switched up the melody this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Heat, repressed..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll call this song... 'D'!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where's that sound coming from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What is it?I can feel it energizing me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It must be the outsiders who just came! Let's go see!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There are more of them, Alty..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's not good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "These lives thirst for music! For energy! For..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What a voice!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Outsider, give us more music!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Alty... I know it's unexpected, but I think the atmosphere here is actually really good."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Why don't we get out the amps and play together?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I guess that would be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah, can't let Frost take all the glory!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I gotta get in on such a badass track!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then let the locals feel the music of AUS!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's just a few notes, but I'm too excited to sit still!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It might be like what the priests do, it's called 'music'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I've never heard anything like it! Who are these people?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria D",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I know, they must be 'Cuicayotl'!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Cuicayotl'? What's that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Oh, that's how you say 'one who sings' in their language."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But it's been a long time since they had a 'Cuicayotl' here, and you've won them over with your music."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I must say, your music is vastly different from that of any other 'Cuicayotl' I've ever heard before!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_074",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But no matter. I find yours a lot more fun!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria E",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Cuicayotl', give us another song!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria F",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I'll give you anything! Just one more song!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "What do we do, Alty?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Let's stay here, Alty!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, I can't let you forget our goal..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But, fine. We've got time."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I never imagined there would be a Messenger here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "And I never thought AUS, from all the magazine covers, would show up here either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Where's Zumama?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "She's making the speaker system you asked for. So I'll be taking you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "How long are you going to stay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Maybe a week, maybe a month, maybe a whole year."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "This place is doing it for us. I think we can have some fun here, at least."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Then this is the right place for you to put on a show."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So cool!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's... some kind of temple?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "That's right. This is where all the tribes used to gather for the 'Mahuizzotia', but it hasn't been used since Gavial left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'Mahuizzotia'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Gavial? That name came up at Rhodes Island... No, it's probably just a common name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You can perform here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "We're going to give the people the best music they've ever heard."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yes, hahaha! Yes! We'll leave the mark of AUS right here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two months later..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "AUS is unbelievable..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They actually did stay for two whole months."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "If Gavial ever comes back, she's going to be blown away by the music we have way out here now."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The people fell in love with their rock and roll."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "So what are they going to perform for us today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...I wonder maybe if I'm their biggest fan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "AUS..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The room is empty. All the toiletries and bedding are neat and tidy, with a piece of paper resting on the table in the center."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They're gone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "There's a note on the table. Let's see..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "'We left. Don't miss us. I hope you enjoyed the music. Also, we left all our records here for you. Have fun. -AUS'"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_075",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "...Heh, they really are unbelievable."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I don't think I'll ever forget that Acahualla place."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "(Humming) It was definitely unforgettable."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But the people there are really noisy, and wild."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Yeah? I love them!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Of course you do. I don't think you'd mind if we left you there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I was definitely thinking about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Don't you think those people have a kind of natural, primal energy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Out of all the countries and cities we've been to, I've never seen people like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2002_Dan_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I love 'em!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Well, you're right about that much."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2003_Frost_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "They really get our music. They're the best audience we've ever had."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I think Frost likes them too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2004_Alty_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "But we can't just show up and flip a whole civilization upside-down. We should stick to singing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "speakerToken": "npc_2001_Aya_rock",
      "operatorId": null,
